# Cast — the Glitchers (hidden resistance)
#
# The underground railroad out of the Internet. A Glitch contact works
# the cells; Hacker_Zero hands out the tools; a VPN node hides your
# trail. The faction stays a rumour until the first guest actually
# escapes (ROLE Guest `on escape` reveals it).

CHARACTER Glitch
  faction: Glitchers
  on scan guest
    -> glitch_offer

# Named performer: the hacker who arms you instead of saving you.
CHARACTER Hacker_Zero
  faction: Glitchers
  on scan guest
    -> hacker_tool

# Prop: a VPN node that cools your heat.
CHARACTER VPN_Node
  faction: Glitchers
  on scan guest
    -> vpn_connect
